  "body": "i've seen this since the first demos at FOSDEM - on all platforms, it seems that it can take up to 30s for a SAS verif request to be received by the target client. It's like /sync doesn't get woken up. I've seen it when talking to both Riot/Web and RiotX - I don't think it's just matrix.org being slow",
